These tests require plan9port.

The standalone TWStat wire-length regression test does not require plan9port.
From the repository root, after running make:

    cc -Iinclude -o test/twstat.out test/twstat.c lib/libixp.a
    ./test/twstat.out

UNIX extension regression checks (no plan9port required):

    python3 test/unix-client.py
    cc -Iinclude -o test/unix-readdir.out test/unix-readdir.c lib/libixp.a
    ./test/unix-readdir.out

The client check uses an independent local peer for directory decoding and
version negotiation. The helper check captures replies to verify entry sizes
and continuation offsets in both protocol versions.
